// Item definitions for TickForge.
// Loaded at coordinator startup via load_items().
// Edit this file to tune equipment stats without recompiling.
//
// Field reference:
//   item_id      — must be unique; matches player_equipment.item_id
//   name         — display name
//   modifiers    — flat stat bonuses applied additively to base stats
//     max_hp         — flat HP bonus
//     attack_power   — flat attack power bonus
//     speed          — flat movement speed bonus (units/second)
//     damage_out     — flat outgoing damage multiplier bonus (+0.1 = +10%)
//     damage_in      — flat incoming damage multiplier bonus (-0.05 = −5% taken)
//     cooldown_reduce — flat cooldown reduction bonus (0.1 = 10%)
